WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.850 --> 01:31.110
[My Journey to You]

01:31.150 --> 01:34.100
[Episode 15]

01:57.650 --> 01:58.300
Swallow it.

01:58.300 --> 01:59.660
Elder Yue, what are you doing?

01:59.660 --> 02:00.860
What did you feed her?

02:01.510 --> 02:01.970
Poison.

02:02.670 --> 02:03.170
What?

02:07.400 --> 02:08.970
The second trial of the Three Realms

02:08.970 --> 02:10.250
that you have to pass

02:10.460 --> 02:12.320
is to detoxify her of this poison.

02:30.650 --> 02:31.780
Your hand is so cold.

02:35.110 --> 02:35.640
Let's go.

02:36.660 --> 02:38.870
This poison is called the Heart Devouring Moon.

02:38.870 --> 02:40.150
The trial taker of the second trial of the Three Realms

02:40.150 --> 02:41.900
has to make the antidote

02:42.040 --> 02:43.550
before the poison takes effect.

02:43.550 --> 02:44.210
Otherwise,

02:44.440 --> 02:47.040
the poisoned person will be tortured to death.

02:47.780 --> 02:49.630
How long will it take to take effect?

02:49.630 --> 02:50.890
It might be three days,

02:51.410 --> 02:52.480
or a month.

02:53.660 --> 02:55.590
Let's see if you can find out

02:55.760 --> 02:57.290
what kind of poison this is.

03:00.030 --> 03:01.270
These are all the books about poison and medicine

03:01.270 --> 03:02.610
in the Yue Residence.

03:03.070 --> 03:04.800
You can look at them at any time.

03:07.300 --> 03:09.100
Young Master Ziyu, you're gifted.

03:09.100 --> 03:10.260
I believe you can

03:10.260 --> 03:12.990
discover the secret of the Heart Devouring Moon.

03:15.970 --> 03:17.300
What's wrong, Miss Yun?

03:19.690 --> 03:20.470
I'm fine.

03:21.670 --> 03:22.780
At the bottom of the bookshelf,

03:22.780 --> 03:24.900
there are books specific to internal injuries.

03:24.900 --> 03:25.700
In the middle,

03:25.720 --> 03:28.050
there are books about external injuries.

03:28.100 --> 03:32.160
Those at the top level are about poisons and the ways of making antidotes.

03:34.860 --> 03:36.290
There are so many books

03:36.540 --> 03:37.400
about poisons.

03:38.750 --> 03:41.010
It's like finding a needle in a haystack.

03:41.020 --> 03:41.650
Elder Yue.

03:42.210 --> 03:43.810
Do you have any suggestions?

03:45.490 --> 03:46.880
On account of our friendship,

03:46.880 --> 03:49.880
I've pointed out to you how the books are categorized here.

03:49.880 --> 03:52.050
It has already saved you a lot of time.

03:52.450 --> 03:53.810
If you continue talking,

03:53.810 --> 03:55.740
you will be suspected of cheating.

03:57.490 --> 03:58.140
Elder Yue.

03:59.000 --> 03:59.900
Tell me then,

04:00.300 --> 04:01.860
if this Heart Devouring Moon

04:01.860 --> 04:03.470
is a cold or hot poison.

04:05.010 --> 04:07.070
I might as well give you the antidote.

04:15.580 --> 04:16.820
Since it's a trial,

04:18.100 --> 04:19.300
it means this mission

04:19.910 --> 04:21.060
can be completed.

04:22.800 --> 04:23.520
However,

04:24.170 --> 04:25.770
there are so many books here.

04:27.070 --> 04:29.000
It's impossible to read all of them

04:29.070 --> 04:29.990
in a short time.

04:32.470 --> 04:33.270
So,

04:34.320 --> 04:35.560
it's impossible

04:36.080 --> 04:38.280
for it to be a short-term potent poison.

04:39.820 --> 04:41.570
They should at least allow the trial takers

04:41.570 --> 04:42.680
to have enough time

04:44.020 --> 04:46.020
to research and make the antidote.

04:48.060 --> 04:48.790
So,

04:50.620 --> 04:52.420
it must be a slow-acting poison.

04:56.460 --> 04:57.659
Slow-acting poison?

04:59.870 --> 05:01.230
Slow-acting poison...

05:04.700 --> 05:05.200
Here.

05:06.800 --> 05:07.300
Am I right,

05:07.300 --> 05:07.910
Elder Yue?

05:18.420 --> 05:19.000
Yun.

05:39.340 --> 05:40.240
You may leave.

06:05.710 --> 06:07.220
Shangguan Qian.

06:09.510 --> 06:10.390
[The murderer is Anonymous.] [The mastermind is Wufeng.]

06:10.390 --> 06:13.080
[Anonymous]

06:15.650 --> 06:17.110
You really are Anonymous.

06:17.790 --> 06:20.180
You knew Gong Shangjue was suspicious of you

06:20.180 --> 06:22.660
and you were afraid that he would close in on you,

06:22.660 --> 06:24.240
so you hurt yourself

06:24.770 --> 06:28.060
to enact a sympathy ploy to rid yourself of the suspicions.

06:29.140 --> 06:30.180
You're smart.

06:30.230 --> 06:31.150
Smart?

06:31.740 --> 06:33.130
I think it's stupid.

06:34.490 --> 06:35.750
Are all Wufeng juniors

06:36.700 --> 06:38.290
so arrogant now?

06:39.620 --> 06:41.080
You came at the right time.

06:41.680 --> 06:43.610
I'm missing a scapegoat.

06:44.070 --> 06:45.000
It's too risky.

06:46.190 --> 06:47.730
If both of us are exposed,

06:48.270 --> 06:50.270
both of us will suffer great losses.

06:50.310 --> 06:51.780
If both of us are exposed,

06:53.020 --> 06:54.390
do you think they'll believe me,

06:54.390 --> 06:56.700
an obedient wife for over a decade,

06:57.640 --> 06:58.590
or believe you,

06:59.280 --> 07:02.410
a suspicious bride who just entered the Gong residence?

07:03.720 --> 07:06.320
They can't do anything to me without evidence.

07:07.020 --> 07:08.880
Instead, you should think carefully about

07:08.880 --> 07:10.210
how you can protect yourself

07:10.210 --> 07:11.540
after being suspected.

07:14.100 --> 07:15.230
Do you think

07:15.730 --> 07:17.410
I don't have an escape plan?

07:18.460 --> 07:19.180
But

07:20.120 --> 07:21.910
I've learned a lesson

07:22.600 --> 07:25.000
about how a Wufeng senior operates indeed.

07:25.340 --> 07:28.190
Sacrificing your fellow apprentices to protect yourself.

07:28.190 --> 07:29.390
You're really cruel.

07:29.920 --> 07:31.980
You can only blame Wufeng's juniors.

07:32.420 --> 07:33.740
They're getting increasingly useless

07:33.740 --> 07:35.140
as the generations pass.

08:43.530 --> 08:44.660
The Fortnight Flies

08:45.450 --> 08:47.670
would make your whole body feel like it's being burned in a raging fire

08:47.670 --> 08:49.670
and you'll be in indescribable agony.

08:49.670 --> 08:51.330
If you don't get rid of it soon,

08:52.190 --> 08:54.050
the poison will attack the heart.

08:54.670 --> 08:56.270
Once it invades the heart...

08:59.310 --> 09:00.440
there'll be no cure.

10:01.610 --> 10:02.410
You're awake?

10:05.850 --> 10:07.250
Why didn't you wake me up?

10:08.350 --> 10:10.080
The Yue residence is very humid

10:10.660 --> 10:11.920
and gets cold at night.

10:12.700 --> 10:13.430
Be careful.

10:14.020 --> 10:15.080
Don't catch a cold.

10:20.220 --> 10:22.150
You even have to take care of me now.

10:25.720 --> 10:26.900
How are you feeling?

10:27.660 --> 10:28.770
Do you feel worse?

10:30.770 --> 10:31.920
Not really.

10:33.100 --> 10:34.830
But I realized that this poison

10:35.350 --> 10:37.350
will disrupt one's internal skill.

10:37.510 --> 10:38.460
If I use my power,

10:39.860 --> 10:43.260
it'll accelerate the poisonous gas's invasion to the heart.

10:43.390 --> 10:45.050
Then try not to use your power.

10:45.520 --> 10:47.280
If there's anything, tell me

10:48.060 --> 10:48.860
and I'll do it.

10:58.310 --> 10:58.910
By the way,

10:59.990 --> 11:01.330
what are the most obvious symptoms

11:01.330 --> 11:03.270
that you feel in your body?

11:04.590 --> 11:05.650
Is it a burning heat

11:06.150 --> 11:07.320
or a piercing cold?

11:08.140 --> 11:08.800
I feel cold.

11:12.700 --> 11:14.630
It's most obvious in my four limbs.

11:15.710 --> 11:16.460
It's like

11:17.640 --> 11:19.570
a numbing and piercing pain you get

11:19.660 --> 11:21.520
when standing on ice barefooted.

11:28.500 --> 11:30.500
I hope I'm not interrupting you two.

11:34.430 --> 11:35.890
Cover yourself with this.

11:41.300 --> 11:42.030
Have you

11:42.390 --> 11:43.250
read all these?

11:44.990 --> 11:47.190
I've sort of finished my rough reading.

11:47.810 --> 11:48.860
Did you find anything?

11:48.860 --> 11:49.990
I've figured out

11:50.370 --> 11:52.750
the characteristics of the Heart Devouring Moon.

11:52.750 --> 11:53.800
In this book,

11:54.300 --> 11:55.900
there's a record of a poison.

11:56.740 --> 11:57.560
Its symptoms

11:57.940 --> 11:59.720
begin and end according to the lunar phase chronology.

11:59.720 --> 12:00.720
The cycle changes

12:01.570 --> 12:02.630
every half a month,

12:03.020 --> 12:05.480
and the gains and losses increase by layers.

12:06.300 --> 12:06.840
Besides,

12:07.940 --> 12:09.990
this kind of poison is very interesting.

12:09.990 --> 12:11.380
According to the poisoned person's

12:11.380 --> 12:13.210
physical condition and internal skill,

12:13.210 --> 12:16.260
the poison will evolve into two very different states,

12:16.260 --> 12:17.920
which is a burning heat poison

12:18.060 --> 12:18.690
or

12:19.150 --> 12:20.210
an icy cold poison.

12:21.700 --> 12:22.360
Therefore,

12:22.900 --> 12:24.430
the way to expel it will be different too.

12:24.430 --> 12:26.530
In order to increase the difficulty of the trial,

12:26.530 --> 12:28.390
you altered the name of the poison

12:29.110 --> 12:30.310
and gave it

12:30.310 --> 12:31.640
a threatening new name,

12:32.030 --> 12:33.490
the Heart Devouring Moon.

12:35.100 --> 12:36.830
But the real name of this poison

12:38.190 --> 12:39.340
is Fortnight Flies.

12:42.100 --> 12:43.110
Fortnight Flies?

12:45.190 --> 12:45.990
That's right.

12:47.200 --> 12:49.260
So the time limit for the creation of our antidote

12:49.260 --> 12:50.120
is half a month.

12:53.340 --> 12:53.840
Not bad.

12:54.950 --> 12:57.940
It only took you one day to figure out what poison it is.

12:57.940 --> 12:59.340
Until now, you're the one

12:59.790 --> 13:01.950
who figured it out in the shortest amount of time.

13:01.950 --> 13:03.780
Elder Yue, thank you for reminding me.

13:03.780 --> 13:05.060
I'm not reminding you.

13:05.750 --> 13:06.950
Don't talk nonsense.

13:08.670 --> 13:09.680
For Fortnight Flies to be effective,

13:09.680 --> 13:10.990
it needs to be made into pills

13:10.990 --> 13:12.460
and consumed directly.

13:14.140 --> 13:15.420
The ingredients include Qishe flowers,

13:15.420 --> 13:16.740
carrion beetle brains,

13:16.740 --> 13:17.800
Bombyx silkworms,

13:18.050 --> 13:19.250
and a key ingredient.

13:20.420 --> 13:21.420
It just so happens

13:21.830 --> 13:24.140
that the page with the key ingredient was torn out.

13:24.140 --> 13:25.270
What did you expect?

13:25.610 --> 13:26.970
If I let you see them all,

13:27.580 --> 13:29.180
what's the point of the test?

13:29.940 --> 13:32.290
The types of medicinal herbs are innumerable.

13:32.290 --> 13:33.690
By tearing this page out,

13:33.780 --> 13:36.840
wouldn't there be no cure for the Heart Devouring Moon?

13:36.910 --> 13:39.370
Finding a solution for the incurable poison

13:39.520 --> 13:40.520
is the challenge.

13:43.300 --> 13:44.430
Then I have to ask you

13:45.020 --> 13:45.990
for something.

13:47.940 --> 13:48.930
I want to ask you

13:49.450 --> 13:51.010
for two pills of Heart Devouring Moon

13:51.010 --> 13:52.270
so that I can study them

13:52.330 --> 13:53.740
to figure out the missing ingredient.

13:53.740 --> 13:55.670
It's not against the rules, right?

13:55.710 --> 13:56.560
Of course not.

14:11.750 --> 14:12.500
Sealing wax?

14:18.130 --> 14:19.370
In these books,

14:19.750 --> 14:23.410
the medicinal properties of many medicinal herbs are mentioned.

14:23.970 --> 14:25.300
Have you tried them all?

14:26.350 --> 14:27.080
For example,

14:27.460 --> 14:27.990
Wujiang.

14:28.890 --> 14:29.480
Wujiang

14:30.150 --> 14:31.220
is mild and tastes bitter.

14:31.220 --> 14:33.750
It's an effective cure for coughing up blood.

14:34.540 --> 14:35.600
What about Jiemao?

14:36.430 --> 14:37.170
Jiemao

14:38.260 --> 14:39.720
is heaty and tastes spicy.

14:40.740 --> 14:43.140
It mainly cures heart and abdominal pains.

14:45.510 --> 14:46.310
What's wrong?

14:48.390 --> 14:48.930
Nothing.

14:50.400 --> 14:52.600
You really have a photographic memory.

14:59.670 --> 15:01.180
The carrion beetle brain is highly poisonous,

15:01.180 --> 15:02.550
which will mess up one's internal skill

15:02.550 --> 15:04.590
and one's martial arts skills will be ruined.

15:04.590 --> 15:06.060
When the poison reaches the heart,

15:06.060 --> 15:07.390
one will die instantly.

15:07.670 --> 15:08.830
After consuming the Bombyx silkworm,

15:08.830 --> 15:10.190
one's blood flow, energy flow,

15:10.190 --> 15:11.660
and breathing will not be smooth,

15:11.660 --> 15:13.260
and one will get whole body chills.

15:13.260 --> 15:14.080
The Qishe flower

15:14.080 --> 15:16.210
will cause heart and abdominal pains.

15:16.520 --> 15:17.400
I've had

15:17.420 --> 15:18.550
all these symptoms.

15:19.560 --> 15:21.250
What can the last ingredient

15:22.020 --> 15:23.350
in the torn-out page be?

15:48.830 --> 15:50.230
The taste of bitterness?

15:52.650 --> 15:53.540
This smells

15:54.230 --> 15:55.890
a little like the Kuxin grass.

15:57.660 --> 15:59.190
Could it be the Kuxin grass?

16:09.780 --> 16:11.780
The Kuxin grass's toxicity is mild.

16:14.820 --> 16:15.750
After taking it,

16:15.810 --> 16:18.070
although it causes one to cough up blood,

16:18.240 --> 16:19.320
it also

16:19.460 --> 16:22.790
treats internal coldness and blood congestion in the body.

16:26.820 --> 16:28.140
The Heart Devouring Moon

16:28.140 --> 16:29.230
is a poison,

16:29.860 --> 16:31.230
so it shouldn't contain

16:32.450 --> 16:33.880
herbs used in antidotes.

16:34.930 --> 16:37.860
Besides, I don't have symptoms of coughing up blood.

16:41.460 --> 16:42.590
In these books,

16:43.270 --> 16:46.330
the medicinal properties of many medicinal herbs are mentioned.

16:46.330 --> 16:47.660
Have you tried them all?

16:49.460 --> 16:50.190
For example,

16:50.660 --> 16:51.230
Wujiang.

16:51.500 --> 16:52.180
Wujiang

16:53.290 --> 16:55.690
is an effective cure for coughing up blood.

16:55.870 --> 16:56.750
What about Jiemao?

16:56.750 --> 16:57.830
Jiemao

16:58.540 --> 17:00.800
mainly cures heart and abdominal pains.

17:00.980 --> 17:01.630
I got it.

17:21.650 --> 17:22.319
But...

17:24.220 --> 17:25.849
what exactly is

17:27.700 --> 17:29.100
the last key ingredient?

17:31.230 --> 17:32.490
The key ingredient...

17:33.860 --> 17:35.120
The key ingredient...

17:42.280 --> 17:42.810
Yun.

17:43.250 --> 17:44.180
What did you say?

17:44.380 --> 17:45.640
The key ingredient...

17:46.800 --> 17:49.060
The key ingredient is the insect eggs...

17:50.540 --> 17:51.940
The Bone-Gnawing Flies.

17:55.520 --> 17:56.300
Insect eggs?

17:56.420 --> 17:57.150
Insect eggs.

18:04.070 --> 18:04.800
Insect eggs.

18:42.310 --> 18:45.420
[Feng]

18:48.210 --> 18:49.770
The Mei who you trained

18:50.380 --> 18:52.640
is outstanding both in skills and looks.

18:53.400 --> 18:54.330
Unfortunately,

18:55.330 --> 18:57.390
she couldn't even send out a message.

18:57.620 --> 18:59.030
In the end, we still had to rely on

18:59.030 --> 19:01.830
the help of my pitiful spy of the lowest level of Chi

19:02.350 --> 19:03.630
to get this.

19:05.210 --> 19:06.540
The game has just begun.

19:07.040 --> 19:08.170
We have a lot of time.

19:08.860 --> 19:09.790
What's the rush?

19:11.030 --> 19:11.760
What is this?

19:13.720 --> 19:16.780
The sample of a fragment of Gong Yuanzhi's hidden weapon

19:16.780 --> 19:17.840
and its blueprint.

19:20.860 --> 19:21.860
It's not worth it.

19:22.180 --> 19:24.240
You're neither surprised nor happy.

19:24.810 --> 19:26.470
What did your resourceful Chi

19:26.490 --> 19:27.480
send you?

19:28.490 --> 19:29.750
You don't need to know.

19:32.480 --> 19:33.450
It's not fair.

19:34.790 --> 19:35.860
You know mine.

19:36.640 --> 19:39.620
It's the fault of your subordinates for being less skilled than others.

19:39.620 --> 19:40.340
Next time,

19:41.150 --> 19:43.150
if she helps to bring something out,

19:43.570 --> 19:45.630
you'll know what treasure I have.

19:47.540 --> 19:49.670
I don't think it's appropriate for you

19:49.940 --> 19:51.530
to be teasing other Hanya lords.

19:51.530 --> 19:52.590
It doesn't matter.

19:54.470 --> 19:55.670
By the way, Miss Ziyi,

19:56.410 --> 19:58.030
there are two more dogs downstairs

19:58.030 --> 19:59.760
and they seem like they'd bite.

20:00.060 --> 20:02.230
They're Jade Guardians from the Gong residence

20:02.230 --> 20:04.890
who're disguised as servants and shadowing me.

20:04.960 --> 20:06.420
I knew about them long ago.

20:07.500 --> 20:09.300
Then why do you keep them around?

20:14.060 --> 20:14.940
I see.

20:16.120 --> 20:18.180
Miss Ziyi, you're really something.

20:18.490 --> 20:21.410
It seems like someone from the Gong residence is going to be bitten by a dog.

20:21.410 --> 20:22.350
How unlucky.

20:40.820 --> 20:41.880
Young Master Ziyu.

20:44.060 --> 20:44.990
Songlan flower.

20:45.260 --> 20:46.100
Zhishangui.

20:46.660 --> 20:47.660
Silver nut grass.

20:47.780 --> 20:48.450
Jiemao.

20:49.310 --> 20:49.900
Wujiang.

20:51.390 --> 20:52.340
Get the medicinal herbs

20:52.340 --> 20:53.430
according to this prescription.

20:53.430 --> 20:53.790
Yes.

20:54.750 --> 20:55.350
By the way,

20:56.100 --> 20:58.030
I also need some Cold Knife Stones.

20:58.110 --> 20:58.510
Oh?

20:59.390 --> 21:01.890
Are there too many mosquitoes, mice, and ants in the Yue residence?

21:01.890 --> 21:03.690
Should I bring you new blankets?

21:04.900 --> 21:06.500
You even know your medicine?

21:06.790 --> 21:08.950
You know that the Cold Knife Stone can repel insects.

21:08.950 --> 21:11.330
People in the Yue residence know a little about medicine.

21:11.330 --> 21:12.790
Excuse my poor knowledge.

21:13.090 --> 21:14.290
I'll go get the herbs.

21:25.130 --> 21:27.460
[Clinic]

21:37.460 --> 21:38.790
What are you doing here?

21:39.800 --> 21:41.660
To get the medicine for Lady Wuji.

21:42.050 --> 21:44.420
Why didn't you ask the servants to come get it?

21:44.420 --> 21:45.590
The Gong residence is in chaos.

21:45.590 --> 21:47.190
The Sword Wielder is worried.

21:47.190 --> 21:49.100
He asked me to take care of it personally.

21:49.100 --> 21:50.700
Let me see your medicine bag.

21:54.190 --> 21:56.120
Young Master Yuanzhi, here you go.

22:00.220 --> 22:00.850
No need.

22:02.300 --> 22:04.160
Thank you, Young Master Yuanzhi.

22:28.220 --> 22:28.880
It's wrong.

22:29.950 --> 22:30.750
What's wrong?

22:31.790 --> 22:32.590
This is Danmu,

22:32.890 --> 22:33.660
not Wujiang.

22:35.410 --> 22:36.650
They look similar,

22:37.300 --> 22:38.830
but Wujiang's core is brown

22:39.340 --> 22:40.980
and it has a circular lenticel.

22:40.980 --> 22:42.910
Congratulations, Sword Wielder.

22:43.540 --> 22:44.670
Were you testing me?

22:45.010 --> 22:45.810
I dare not.

22:46.590 --> 22:47.970
Passing Danmu off as Wujiang

22:47.970 --> 22:50.030
is Elder Yue's surprise test for you.

22:50.300 --> 22:52.430
Congratulations on passing the test.

22:52.510 --> 22:54.370
This is the Wujiang you asked for.

23:07.030 --> 23:09.490
Has Lady Wuji finished taking the medicine?

23:10.070 --> 23:11.880
How's your investigation going?

23:11.880 --> 23:13.810
According to the clinic's medical records,

23:13.810 --> 23:18.420
there were no doctors who left the valley to visit patients at their homes two years ago.

23:18.420 --> 23:19.780
Then why did this neighbor

23:19.780 --> 23:21.380
lie?

23:22.180 --> 23:24.440
Maybe the medical records were altered.

23:26.380 --> 23:27.830
We lost another clue.

23:47.740 --> 23:48.270
Brother.

23:49.340 --> 23:50.540
Just now, you asked me to check

23:50.540 --> 23:54.380
the records of doctors who'd left Jiuchen Valley to visit patients at their homes.

23:54.380 --> 23:55.840
I went to the clinic today.

23:57.220 --> 23:59.150
Jin Fan was also investigating it.

24:00.060 --> 24:01.190
What a coincidence.

24:01.740 --> 24:02.270
Brother.

24:02.940 --> 24:04.540
What are you investigating?

24:06.550 --> 24:08.610
I'm investigating Housekeeper Jia.

24:09.910 --> 24:10.910
Housekeeper Jia?

24:11.760 --> 24:12.940
The valley's stronghold

24:12.940 --> 24:14.740
sent a message over previously,

24:14.990 --> 24:18.250
that said that Housekeeper Jia's wife and son are missing.

24:18.270 --> 24:20.100
Then why was Jin Fan investigating this too?

24:20.100 --> 24:22.430
Housekeeper Jia's son was seriously ill.

24:22.910 --> 24:23.630
It is said

24:24.470 --> 24:25.480
that he was cured

24:25.750 --> 24:28.080
by the Gong family's doctor two years ago.

24:28.570 --> 24:29.200
I guess

24:29.970 --> 24:31.550
he also wants to investigate

24:31.550 --> 24:33.880
if there is anything suspicious about it.

24:35.330 --> 24:38.460
Brother, so you're also reading medical books for this?

24:42.580 --> 24:43.970
A dying man

24:44.830 --> 24:46.470
suddenly came back to life,

24:47.790 --> 24:49.430
and became very strong.

24:50.900 --> 24:52.300
It's suspicious indeed.

24:59.540 --> 25:00.740
What did you think of?

25:02.750 --> 25:03.320
Nothing.

25:03.460 --> 25:04.520
I thought too much.

25:05.310 --> 25:06.340
It's impossible.

25:07.290 --> 25:10.950
Treating a disease can only symptomatically relieve the lesion.

25:10.960 --> 25:13.560
The patient wouldn't suddenly become strong.

25:14.050 --> 25:16.910
That just belongs in the plots of legendary novels.

25:20.290 --> 25:22.150
Looks like we need to find the time

25:22.620 --> 25:24.750
to go to the back hill and ask Elder Yue.

25:24.830 --> 25:25.360
Brother.

25:25.670 --> 25:27.200
When you go to the back hill,

25:27.390 --> 25:28.820
can you also inquire about

25:28.820 --> 25:31.510
Gong Ziyu's progress in his trial of the Second Realm?

25:31.510 --> 25:32.910
Whether I inquire or not,

25:33.800 --> 25:35.330
the results won't change.

25:35.820 --> 25:36.350
Brother.

25:37.080 --> 25:38.210
Aren't you worried?

25:40.100 --> 25:41.160
If he is useless,

25:42.100 --> 25:43.760
then there's no need to worry.

25:44.940 --> 25:46.450
If he's really capable,

25:48.050 --> 25:50.110
then there's no need to worry either.

26:00.690 --> 26:01.620
Songlan flower.

26:01.930 --> 26:02.920
Zhishangui.

26:03.130 --> 26:04.130
Silver nut grass.

26:04.370 --> 26:05.020
Jiemao.

26:05.420 --> 26:06.160
Wujiang.

26:07.840 --> 26:09.500
Boiled in half-cooked water,

26:09.940 --> 26:12.940
with ochre as the ingredient to enhance the efficacy.

26:13.640 --> 26:14.160
Wait.

26:22.080 --> 26:23.550
You're so smart.

26:23.930 --> 26:25.790
You knew to use Cold Knife Stones.

26:27.250 --> 26:28.530
How did you guess

26:28.810 --> 26:31.010
that there were insect eggs in the pill?

26:34.310 --> 26:35.110
It's a secret.

26:36.580 --> 26:37.180
All right.

26:38.950 --> 26:39.580
Elder Yue.

26:40.150 --> 26:41.480
Is this antidote right?

26:41.580 --> 26:42.330
Did I pass?

26:43.580 --> 26:45.130
You'll know if it's right or not

26:45.130 --> 26:46.130
after you take it.

26:49.270 --> 26:50.470
I even have to take it?

26:50.990 --> 26:51.830
Of course.

27:24.310 --> 27:26.370
Don't blame me for not reminding you.

27:26.430 --> 27:28.070
The medicinal properties of the herbs you used

27:28.070 --> 27:29.420
are very strong.

27:30.150 --> 27:31.550
When combined together,

27:31.690 --> 27:32.950
it's even more potent.

27:34.270 --> 27:37.400
It may be more tormenting than the Heart Devouring Moon.

28:00.740 --> 28:01.350
Elder Yue.

28:02.340 --> 28:04.140
I have another question for you.

28:04.820 --> 28:07.570
Under the condition that you've consumed the Herb Elixir,

28:07.570 --> 28:09.030
will you still be poisoned

28:09.740 --> 28:11.800
if you take the Heart Devouring Moon?

28:11.900 --> 28:14.880
The Herb Elixir doesn't work on the Heart Devouring Moon.

28:14.880 --> 28:16.940
If you take the Heart Devouring Moon,

28:17.740 --> 28:19.270
you will still be poisoned.

28:41.840 --> 28:46.080
♫The mountains become sand with the wind♫

28:49.250 --> 28:53.440
♫The river takes me home♫

28:58.690 --> 29:01.670
♫The cloud in the sky doesn't speak♫

29:02.220 --> 29:05.600
♫Where are you, where are you?♫

29:05.790 --> 29:08.440
♫How are you?♫

29:10.660 --> 29:15.500
♫When the clouds cry, it becomes sunset♫

29:17.780 --> 29:21.630
♫Look at the sky, flowers bloom♫

29:27.200 --> 29:30.290
♫Can the clouds and soil meet?♫

29:30.810 --> 29:33.350
♫Every wave♫

29:33.900 --> 29:37.070
♫Is asking about him♫

29:37.450 --> 29:44.150
♫The ground will nurture♫

29:44.610 --> 29:47.700
♫And a pair of wings will grow♫

29:47.740 --> 29:51.230
♫Take me to fly♫

29:51.690 --> 29:55.690
♫The clouds and soil are different♫

29:56.210 --> 29:59.030
♫You always tell me that♫

29:59.300 --> 30:01.690
♫But in my heart♫

30:02.350 --> 30:04.910
♫There's a little light♫

30:23.840 --> 30:25.100
Why do you

30:25.620 --> 30:26.700
look so pale?

30:29.070 --> 30:29.780
Do I?

30:31.380 --> 30:33.780
Maybe I neglected my health and didn't rest well

30:33.780 --> 30:36.310
because I was busy researching the antidote.

30:44.700 --> 30:45.960
Why are you lying to me?

30:50.730 --> 30:51.590
Don’t be angry.

30:53.250 --> 30:57.110
I just wanted to pass the trial of the Second Realm as soon as possible.

30:57.850 --> 30:58.510
After all,

30:58.800 --> 31:00.350
only by understanding the realest

31:00.350 --> 31:02.390
and most direct feeling of being poisoned firsthand

31:02.390 --> 31:04.220
can I develop the antidote as soon as possible.

31:04.220 --> 31:05.750
-I...
-You're still lying!

31:15.230 --> 31:16.010
I'm sorry.

31:22.430 --> 31:23.360
Is it worth it?

31:26.380 --> 31:27.310
Of course.

31:31.410 --> 31:32.470
You are the most...

31:39.520 --> 31:41.320
the most important person to me.

31:49.500 --> 31:51.050
Don't lie to me ever again.

31:56.050 --> 31:57.600
No matter what happens,

32:01.180 --> 32:02.310
we can discuss

32:03.070 --> 32:04.930
and decide everything together.

32:06.720 --> 32:08.640
Don't act tough alone, okay?

32:13.000 --> 32:14.600
I won't lie to you ever again.

32:16.960 --> 32:18.490
Even if I do something wrong

32:18.970 --> 32:20.170
or something stupid,

32:21.700 --> 32:23.870
you can hit me, scold me,

32:24.310 --> 32:25.990
or even kill me with a knife.

32:26.870 --> 32:27.540
But...

32:31.770 --> 32:33.630
I will never lie to you ever again.

32:39.830 --> 32:40.690
What about you?

32:44.270 --> 32:44.830
What?

32:49.100 --> 32:50.150
Will you lie to me?

32:58.930 --> 33:00.650
I'm undeniably loyal to you.

33:49.350 --> 33:51.580
This is the message sent out by the Chi and Mei

33:51.580 --> 33:53.030
in the Gong residence.

33:55.990 --> 33:56.790
Ten years ago,

33:57.360 --> 33:59.780
because we weren't familiar with the terrain of the Gong residence,

33:59.780 --> 34:01.180
we suffered a great loss.

34:03.560 --> 34:05.160
When the Yun map is complete,

34:05.680 --> 34:08.480
the Gong residence will definitely be destroyed.

34:10.070 --> 34:11.790
The Gong family's hidden weapons

34:11.790 --> 34:13.120
are indeed invincible.

34:13.690 --> 34:15.620
Gong Yuanzhi's exclusive hidden weapon

34:15.620 --> 34:16.810
is even more unique

34:17.380 --> 34:18.370
and exquisite.

34:20.300 --> 34:22.159
Although we have the drawing now,

34:22.550 --> 34:23.889
we'll still need time

34:24.969 --> 34:25.900
to make a sample.

34:26.770 --> 34:27.679
There are

34:28.030 --> 34:29.949
four kinds of strange poison on the hidden weapon.

34:29.949 --> 34:31.610
Each one is rare in the world.

34:32.380 --> 34:33.060
Currently,

34:33.310 --> 34:35.040
we've figured out three kinds.

34:35.370 --> 34:37.030
And I believe we'll figure out

34:37.110 --> 34:38.239
the last one soon.

34:39.340 --> 34:40.540
Then Gong Yuanzhi...

34:42.659 --> 34:43.590
will be useless.

35:03.560 --> 35:07.800
♫The mountains become sand with the wind♫

35:10.960 --> 35:15.160
♫The river takes me home♫

35:20.410 --> 35:23.390
♫The cloud in the sky doesn't speak♫

35:23.940 --> 35:27.320
♫Where are you, where are you?♫

35:27.510 --> 35:30.160
♫How are you?♫

35:32.390 --> 35:37.220
♫When the clouds cry, it becomes sunset♫

35:39.510 --> 35:43.350
♫Look at the sky, flowers bloom♫

35:43.440 --> 35:45.240
[Newly Revised Materia Medica]

35:48.920 --> 35:52.010
♫Can the clouds and soil meet?♫

35:52.530 --> 35:55.080
♫Every wave♫

35:55.620 --> 35:58.800
♫Is asking about him♫

35:59.150 --> 36:05.860
♫The ground will nurture♫

36:06.320 --> 36:09.430
♫And a pair of wings will grow♫

36:09.450 --> 36:12.960
♫Take me to fly♫

36:13.420 --> 36:17.410
♫The clouds and soil are different♫

36:15.750 --> 36:17.010
My legs are paralyzed.

36:17.930 --> 36:20.750
♫You always tell me that♫

36:21.020 --> 36:23.420
♫But in my heart♫

36:24.070 --> 36:26.630
♫There's a little light♫

36:31.680 --> 36:34.720
♫The cloud in the sky doesn't speak♫

36:35.080 --> 36:36.780
♫Looking at the waves♫

36:37.010 --> 36:38.420
♫Take him♫

36:38.780 --> 36:41.360
♫To travel all over the world♫

36:43.630 --> 36:44.290
Let me do it.

36:45.980 --> 36:48.990
♫Flowers on the muddy shore amidst the waves♫

36:49.550 --> 36:51.090
♫That cloud♫

36:51.340 --> 36:52.920
♫Turned into rain♫

36:53.130 --> 36:55.770
♫To stay with him♫

36:57.980 --> 37:02.310
♫You are the frost under my wings♫

37:05.120 --> 37:08.690
♫Draw a flash of silver light in the sky♫

37:14.530 --> 37:17.520
♫Get into my heart♫

37:18.060 --> 37:20.780
♫Wearing the cloud as clothes♫

37:21.130 --> 37:24.280
♫Wander around with me♫

37:24.790 --> 37:31.450
♫The ground will nurture♫

37:31.890 --> 37:35.080
♫And a pair of wings will grow♫

37:35.100 --> 37:38.590
♫Take me to fly♫

37:38.990 --> 37:43.070
♫The clouds and soil are different♫

37:43.470 --> 37:46.360
♫You always tell me that♫

37:46.600 --> 37:49.180
♫But in my heart♫

37:49.730 --> 37:53.050
♫There's a little light♫

37:57.270 --> 38:00.440
♫The cloud in the sky doesn't speak♫

38:02.670 --> 38:06.470
♫Do you see me?♫

38:11.490 --> 38:14.750
♫The most dazzling sunset♫

38:15.210 --> 38:18.380
♫Turned into rain and feathers♫

38:17.860 --> 38:19.290
Gong Ziyu

38:18.740 --> 38:22.020
♫To stay with her♫

38:19.750 --> 38:20.680
is soft-hearted

38:21.070 --> 38:22.070
and sentimental.

38:22.940 --> 38:25.860
He's even the Sword Wielder of the entire Gong family.

38:25.860 --> 38:27.690
If you were an ordinary woman,

38:28.380 --> 38:29.440
you'd be so blessed

38:30.170 --> 38:31.200
to marry him.

38:32.060 --> 38:32.820
Am I right?

38:34.250 --> 38:35.250
What should I say?

38:36.030 --> 38:36.600
Or...

38:38.050 --> 38:39.380
What do you want to hear?

38:39.940 --> 38:41.050
I want to hear

38:41.620 --> 38:42.880
your honest feelings.

38:43.830 --> 38:45.720
He's high-ranking,

38:45.950 --> 38:47.120
young, handsome,

38:47.750 --> 38:49.600
and has a passionate heart.

38:50.320 --> 38:51.920
He cares for you attentively

38:52.440 --> 38:53.640
and is devoted to you.

38:55.260 --> 38:57.790
Will you fall in love with him because of this?

38:58.530 --> 39:00.530
Wufeng only trained us how to fight.

39:02.730 --> 39:03.860
We were never taught

39:05.020 --> 39:06.080
how to fall in love.

39:07.310 --> 39:09.840
You don't need to be taught how to fall in love,

39:09.860 --> 39:10.990
nor is it teachable.

39:12.060 --> 39:13.120
That means I won't.

39:14.500 --> 39:14.900
Okay.

39:16.580 --> 39:17.530
That's good.

39:19.420 --> 39:20.510
If a spy

39:20.890 --> 39:22.630
falls in love with her target,

39:23.200 --> 39:25.000
she'll face a tragic ending.

39:27.690 --> 39:28.770
I still remember

39:29.310 --> 39:32.460
that Wufeng had a foolishly infatuated assassin.

39:34.100 --> 39:35.410
It should be

39:36.870 --> 39:38.030
described as

39:38.960 --> 39:39.820
a tragic death.

39:41.370 --> 39:43.430
Do you know what's the most fatal weakness

39:43.430 --> 39:44.980
of a female spy?

39:47.570 --> 39:49.420
The disparity between men and women's strengths?

39:49.420 --> 39:50.220
No.

39:51.580 --> 39:53.580
It's not about martial arts skills,

39:53.620 --> 39:55.030
willpower, or fear...

39:57.530 --> 39:58.240
but this.

40:00.340 --> 40:01.800
The biggest taboo for a spy

40:02.910 --> 40:03.910
is to fall in love.

40:05.530 --> 40:06.620
Women have always

40:08.330 --> 40:11.060
been more prone to becoming infatuated than men.

40:12.090 --> 40:13.240
Don't be tempted.

40:14.710 --> 40:16.160
This is my advice to you.

40:17.700 --> 40:19.900
I hope you can really control yourself.

40:21.520 --> 40:22.580
Don't hurt others,

40:24.020 --> 40:25.130
or yourself.

40:35.720 --> 40:36.880
Miss Yun, I just hope

40:36.920 --> 40:39.650
that you won't let the Sword Wielder down from now on.

40:39.650 --> 40:40.160
He...

40:43.710 --> 40:45.040
is a foolishly good man.

40:57.260 --> 40:57.950
From now on,

40:59.380 --> 41:00.770
I won't let you suffer.

41:10.410 --> 41:11.210
Is it worth it?

41:11.900 --> 41:12.870
Of course.

41:16.920 --> 41:17.980
You are the most...

41:23.350 --> 41:25.150
the most important person to me.

42:00.810 --> 42:02.030
He's still sleeping.

42:02.390 --> 42:03.250
Give it to me.

42:03.750 --> 42:04.130
Yes.

42:06.700 --> 42:07.890
Bring these for me.

42:10.480 --> 42:11.320
False daisy,

42:11.490 --> 42:12.350
glossy privet,

42:12.600 --> 42:13.350
and calcite?

42:14.070 --> 42:14.600
Miss Yun.

42:15.290 --> 42:16.910
These are all things that induce coldness.

42:16.910 --> 42:18.380
You are poisoned by cold poison.

42:18.380 --> 42:19.550
You can't take these.

42:19.550 --> 42:20.280
Hurry and go.

42:21.860 --> 42:22.330
Yes.

42:59.070 --> 43:00.120
Your injury

43:00.140 --> 43:01.510
is more or less fine now.

43:01.760 --> 43:03.300
Apply the ointment a few more times

43:03.300 --> 43:06.700
to reduce swelling and eliminate blood stasis, and you'll be fine.

43:06.700 --> 43:08.230
My body of scars

43:08.340 --> 43:09.430
is really ugly.

43:10.310 --> 43:12.330
Why don't you add golden gentian

43:12.480 --> 43:13.840
into my prescription?

43:14.300 --> 43:15.230
Miss Shangguan.

43:15.310 --> 43:17.310
It's no doubt that you're from a family of renowned doctors.

43:17.310 --> 43:19.870
The golden gentian can promote the healing of wounds

43:19.870 --> 43:21.410
and helps to prevent scarring.

43:21.410 --> 43:23.380
It's perfect for your injury.

43:23.930 --> 43:25.330
But a few days ago,

43:25.380 --> 43:26.740
Young Master Yuanzhi was injured

43:26.740 --> 43:27.940
and used up a lot of it.

43:27.960 --> 43:30.380
The rest of the golden gentian in the pharmacy

43:30.380 --> 43:34.440
was taken by the subordinates of the Yu residence to be given to Lady Wuji.

43:34.580 --> 43:35.640
Thank you, doctor.

43:38.820 --> 43:39.620
Young Master.

43:40.860 --> 43:41.660
You may leave.

43:41.760 --> 43:42.250
Yes.

43:56.700 --> 43:57.230
Well.

43:58.020 --> 44:00.100
Why are you in such a hurry to remove the scars?

44:00.100 --> 44:02.830
Are you worried that my brother will dislike you?

44:03.300 --> 44:04.430
Young Master Shangjue is not someone shallow

44:04.430 --> 44:06.290
who judges people by their looks.

44:06.980 --> 44:09.240
Then what does my brother like about you?

44:09.480 --> 44:12.280
Is it because you're knowledgeable and sensible?

44:16.470 --> 44:18.070
When you grow up,

44:18.970 --> 44:20.700
you'll naturally understand.

44:26.140 --> 44:26.810
Also,

44:28.240 --> 44:30.170
why did you so kindly

44:30.740 --> 44:33.140
give all the golden gentian in the pharmacy

44:33.190 --> 44:34.430
to Lady Wuji?

44:35.690 --> 44:37.360
It's an order from the Yu residence.

44:37.360 --> 44:38.620
Who'd dare to disobey?

44:39.410 --> 44:41.140
That's the Lord Sword Wielder.

44:42.960 --> 44:46.420
But you've never bowed down to that Lord Sword Wielder before.

44:52.540 --> 44:54.960
But thank you for specially making this visit

44:54.960 --> 44:56.260
just to see me.

44:57.920 --> 44:58.980
I'm here to tell you

44:59.420 --> 45:01.140
that during these few days when my brother is not around,

45:01.140 --> 45:02.740
you should recuperate well.

45:03.090 --> 45:04.290
Don't wander around.

45:04.860 --> 45:06.260
Where did Young Master Shangjue go?

45:06.260 --> 45:07.060
The back hill.

45:07.420 --> 45:08.220
The back hill?

45:09.580 --> 45:11.780
The Gong residence even has a back hill?

45:14.210 --> 45:15.070
As an outsider,

45:15.570 --> 45:16.770
why do you ask so much?

45:18.470 --> 45:19.200
I'm leaving.

45:23.870 --> 45:24.670
Your tea...

45:25.910 --> 45:26.640
is ordinary.

45:29.630 --> 45:30.890
Your brother chose it.

46:06.060 --> 46:08.160
My eyelid has been twitching recently.

46:08.160 --> 46:09.360
I'm so anxious.

46:14.150 --> 46:14.810
Which side?

46:15.700 --> 46:16.580
As the saying goes,

46:16.580 --> 46:17.630
twitching on the left eye forecasts fortune

46:17.630 --> 46:20.030
but twitching on the right eye forecasts disaster.

46:20.030 --> 46:20.910
Could Gong Ziyu and the lot

46:20.910 --> 46:22.420
have encountered some difficulties

46:22.420 --> 46:23.880
and are caught in trouble?

46:24.550 --> 46:26.350
You're making me caught in your troubles.

46:26.350 --> 46:28.750
Then you should face the troubles head-on.

46:58.010 --> 46:58.520
Here.

47:03.330 --> 47:04.860
What is this prescription?

47:07.340 --> 47:09.600
I read it in the medical books over there.

47:10.370 --> 47:12.660
Although it can't get rid of the Heart Devouring Moon,

47:12.660 --> 47:13.900
it can greatly reduce

47:13.900 --> 47:16.360
the pain of being tortured by the hot poison.

47:32.870 --> 47:34.260
I do feel much better.

47:35.290 --> 47:36.340
It doesn't take effect this quickly.

47:36.340 --> 47:37.600
Don't try to please me.

47:41.020 --> 47:41.820
Lord Ziyu.

47:42.180 --> 47:43.690
if you randomly try different medicines again,

47:43.690 --> 47:45.290
your condition will worsen.

47:46.040 --> 47:47.100
You're really bold

47:47.660 --> 47:49.320
to test the medicine on yourself.

47:49.320 --> 47:50.470
As the Sword Wielder,

47:50.470 --> 47:53.070
you really don't care about your health at all.

47:54.090 --> 47:56.000
Shennong even tasted hundreds of herbs.

47:56.000 --> 47:56.990
This is nothing.

47:58.020 --> 47:58.770
Actually,

47:59.660 --> 48:01.700
the Sword Wielder is the head of the Gong family,

48:01.700 --> 48:02.870
so it's understandable

48:02.870 --> 48:04.930
that you test the medicine on others.

48:05.500 --> 48:07.760
I've also tested my medicines on others.

48:08.350 --> 48:09.640
In the previous trial,

48:10.010 --> 48:11.940
there were countless casualties.

48:12.320 --> 48:14.050
As long as the trial takers ask,

48:14.300 --> 48:15.430
within the Gong residence,

48:15.430 --> 48:17.910
there will be people who'd volunteer themselves for medicine testing.

48:17.910 --> 48:19.840
As long as the antidote can be made,

48:19.870 --> 48:20.800
some sacrifices

48:21.150 --> 48:22.050
and some costs

48:22.660 --> 48:23.480
are allowed.

48:29.320 --> 48:30.920
I don't want innocent people

48:31.070 --> 48:32.600
to test the medicine for me.

48:34.090 --> 48:35.620
No one's life is worthless.

48:38.190 --> 48:40.940
Even if it's a mayfly who's born in the morning and dies at night,

48:40.940 --> 48:41.630
I don't need it

48:41.630 --> 48:44.960
to sacrifice for the hardships of the trials that I deserve.

48:45.540 --> 48:46.870
I'm not afraid of death.

48:48.740 --> 48:49.640
What I fear

48:51.260 --> 48:52.690
is that the person I love

48:53.860 --> 48:54.920
dies because of me.

48:58.460 --> 48:59.560
Actually, I really like

48:59.560 --> 49:01.220
the name you gave this poison.

49:01.820 --> 49:03.080
Heart Devouring Moon.

49:04.050 --> 49:05.710
Watching your beloved suffer

49:07.010 --> 49:08.060
indeed feels like

49:08.630 --> 49:10.290
your heart is being devoured.

49:15.380 --> 49:16.340
In that case,

49:16.870 --> 49:17.870
I want to tell you

49:18.610 --> 49:19.390
that this realm...

49:19.390 --> 49:20.140
Elder Yue.

49:45.730 --> 49:46.860
Go over there first.

49:52.650 --> 49:53.980
What are you doing here?

49:54.390 --> 49:56.120
I'm not here for you, of course.

49:56.450 --> 49:57.380
I have something

49:57.480 --> 49:58.940
to consult with Elder Yue.

50:03.230 --> 50:05.160
Miss Yun is coughing up blood a lot.

50:05.170 --> 50:06.130
Elder Yue,

50:06.870 --> 50:09.850
please ask the servants to bring some blood-enriching medicine.

50:09.850 --> 50:10.650
Interesting.

50:11.410 --> 50:13.070
Although I'm not here for you,

50:13.990 --> 50:14.870
I didn't expect

50:17.650 --> 50:19.510
that I'd have an unexpected gain.

50:24.370 --> 50:25.430
What are you doing?

50:26.140 --> 50:26.890
Miss Yun.

50:28.010 --> 50:29.740
Looks like you can move freely.

50:31.180 --> 50:31.780
Elder Yue.

50:32.380 --> 50:34.900
I want to take Yun Weishan back for interrogation.

50:34.900 --> 50:36.160
What's wrong with you?

50:37.100 --> 50:38.720
How dare you take Miss Yun back for interrogation?

50:38.720 --> 50:39.480
Because...

50:42.020 --> 50:43.800
she's a Wufeng spy.

50:44.290 --> 50:44.880
What?

50:45.880 --> 50:48.130
I've been through the Trial of the Three Realms,

50:48.130 --> 50:50.530
and I'm aware of the Heart Devouring Moon's potency.

50:50.530 --> 50:52.060
First, one's internal skill is depleted

50:52.060 --> 50:53.910
and one gets intermittent chest pains.

50:53.910 --> 50:55.460
Then one starts coughing up blood.

50:55.460 --> 50:57.190
After the blood-coughing ends,

50:57.190 --> 50:58.780
starting with one foot,

50:59.210 --> 51:01.050
one's four limbs will gradually become paralyzed.

51:01.050 --> 51:02.170
Am I right?

51:03.680 --> 51:04.810
However,

51:04.860 --> 51:07.150
Yun Weishan's symptoms stopped at the stage of coughing up blood.

51:07.150 --> 51:08.640
When she was avoiding me just now,

51:08.640 --> 51:09.960
she was also very agile.

51:09.960 --> 51:12.090
There are no signs of paralysis at all.

51:12.630 --> 51:13.700
So obviously,

51:14.460 --> 51:15.660
she wasn't poisoned.

51:16.900 --> 51:18.900
Her body is resistant to the poison.

51:19.600 --> 51:20.910
In the past decade,

51:21.470 --> 51:23.510
in order to resist the Gong family's poison,

51:23.510 --> 51:25.090
all those from Wufeng

51:25.660 --> 51:26.470
have received

51:26.470 --> 51:29.070
strict and cruel poison resistance training.

51:29.690 --> 51:31.560
The daughter of an ordinary family

51:31.560 --> 51:33.560
would never be trained like this.

51:43.890 --> 51:45.110
What does that prove?

51:46.600 --> 51:48.370
Everyone has different physiques,

51:48.370 --> 51:50.890
and hence different symptoms from poisoning.

51:50.890 --> 51:52.700
Just like how Miss Yun's poisoned by cold poison

51:52.700 --> 51:54.430
and I'm poisoned by hot poison.

51:54.630 --> 51:55.660
Don't you agree,

51:56.920 --> 51:57.570
Elder Yue?

51:58.200 --> 51:59.400
Different physiques

52:00.070 --> 52:02.200
result in different symptoms indeed.

52:03.390 --> 52:04.060
But...

52:05.260 --> 52:07.320
Elder Yue, just be straightforward.

52:08.050 --> 52:09.710
But the symptoms of paralysis

52:09.840 --> 52:11.240
will definitely appear.

52:11.410 --> 52:14.000
But it has been a long time and Miss Yun still hasn't shown this symptom yet.

52:14.000 --> 52:16.230
It's either as Young Master Shangjue said,

52:16.230 --> 52:19.250
that she has been through poison resistance training,

52:19.250 --> 52:19.880
or

52:20.930 --> 52:22.660
she knows this poison very well

52:23.940 --> 52:25.540
and has detoxified herself.

52:28.030 --> 52:29.960
The key ingredient is insect eggs.

52:30.110 --> 52:31.170
Bring these for me.

52:31.500 --> 52:34.290
False daisy, glossy privet, and calcite?

52:34.920 --> 52:35.450
Miss Yun.

52:35.790 --> 52:37.490
These are all things that induce coldness.

52:37.490 --> 52:39.890
I read them in the medical books over there.

52:40.830 --> 52:43.540
Although it can't get rid of the Heart Devouring Moon,

52:43.540 --> 52:44.950
it can greatly reduce

52:45.140 --> 52:47.600
the pain of being tortured by the hot poison.

52:48.640 --> 52:50.260
So we'll find out the truth

52:50.740 --> 52:51.900
if you let me take her back

52:51.900 --> 52:53.030
for interrogation.

52:56.060 --> 52:57.190
If you take her away,

52:57.740 --> 52:59.070
will she still be alive?

53:00.740 --> 53:01.590
I won't allow it.

53:01.590 --> 53:03.750
For the safety of the whole Gong family,

53:03.750 --> 53:04.950
you have no choice but to allow it.

53:04.950 --> 53:06.150
Elder Yue is present.

53:06.560 --> 53:07.830
How dare you be so audacious

53:07.830 --> 53:09.130
and defy the Sword Wielder's orders?

53:09.130 --> 53:11.460
You haven't even passed the second trial.

53:11.820 --> 53:14.280
How can you call yourself the Sword Wielder?

53:14.650 --> 53:16.210
Besides, for a woman,

53:16.650 --> 53:19.190
you're risking the lives of the entire Gong family.

53:19.190 --> 53:21.990
Are you even deserving of the Sword Wielder title?

53:23.140 --> 53:25.600
She has lived in the Yu residence for so long.

53:26.150 --> 53:27.620
I believe what I've seen.

53:27.780 --> 53:28.730
I also believe

53:29.760 --> 53:31.170
my own judgment.

53:32.150 --> 53:34.010
The two of you don't have to argue.

53:35.870 --> 53:36.730
I have an idea.

53:55.620 --> 53:56.270
Elder Yue.

53:57.510 --> 53:58.510
This medicine...

53:59.660 --> 54:00.390
Don't worry.

54:01.440 --> 54:03.650
This medicine is called the truth grass.

54:03.650 --> 54:04.580
Those who take it

54:04.870 --> 54:06.000
will tell the truth.

54:06.460 --> 54:08.120
It doesn't harm one's health.

54:08.140 --> 54:10.470
It only controls one's mind temporarily,

54:11.070 --> 54:12.730
which makes one unable to lie.

54:38.880 --> 54:40.610
May I begin the interrogation?

54:45.770 --> 54:46.420
Yun.

54:55.210 --> 54:58.070
This is what happens when your identity is exposed.

54:58.630 --> 55:00.160
So as a last resort,

55:01.780 --> 55:03.440
you have to take your own life.

55:04.470 --> 55:06.130
If you don't cut it off in time,

55:06.910 --> 55:08.340
you will be tortured

55:09.200 --> 55:10.800
and die without an identity.

55:11.910 --> 55:12.640
Are you okay?

55:17.940 --> 55:18.550
Why?

55:18.950 --> 55:20.750
Do you still want to protect her?

55:22.880 --> 55:24.680
Miss Yun is from my Yu residence.

55:24.770 --> 55:25.900
She's also my bride.

55:26.970 --> 55:28.070
If anyone has to interrogate her,

55:28.070 --> 55:29.050
it'd be me.

55:34.680 --> 55:38.400
[Yu]

55:46.780 --> 55:48.070
Will you hurt me?

55:50.610 --> 55:51.320
No.

55:52.790 --> 55:54.120
Will you hurt my family?

55:54.870 --> 55:55.630
No.

55:56.740 --> 55:57.500
No.

55:58.170 --> 56:00.310
Stop asking unnecessary questions.

56:01.530 --> 56:02.860
If you dare not face it,

56:03.720 --> 56:04.790
then let me help you

56:06.340 --> 56:07.900
get to the point.

56:12.980 --> 56:14.560
Are you a Wufeng spy?

56:23.590 --> 56:24.200
Tell me.

56:25.460 --> 56:26.240
Who are you?

56:28.590 --> 56:29.200
You...

56:30.820 --> 56:31.560
Tell me.

56:38.280 --> 56:40.250
Are you a Wufeng spy?

56:42.000 --> 56:44.010
It has nothing to do with Wufeng.

56:45.900 --> 56:46.770
No.

56:57.860 --> 56:58.970
Then who are you?

57:00.820 --> 57:01.520
Who are you?

57:03.510 --> 57:04.570
As the last resort,

57:06.240 --> 57:07.900
you have to take your own life.

57:12.380 --> 57:14.110
The daughter of the Yun family.

57:14.460 --> 57:15.360
Lixi Town's...

57:16.470 --> 57:17.340
Yun Weishan.

57:18.570 --> 57:19.690
Yun Weishan.

57:35.220 --> 57:38.480
The effects of the medicine will subside after 15 minutes.

57:39.770 --> 57:41.250
Take good care of Miss Yun.

57:52.590 --> 57:53.430
Good job.

57:54.860 --> 57:57.800
You're the only one who could persevere for four hours

57:57.800 --> 57:59.200
and not reveal the truth.

58:16.540 --> 58:17.340
It's okay now.

58:18.370 --> 58:19.500
It's all in the past.

58:38.260 --> 58:39.920
No one will bully you anymore.

58:43.620 --> 58:44.620
I'll protect you.

59:10.770 --> 59:11.400
Do you...

59:15.300 --> 59:16.170
like me?

59:28.560 --> 59:29.490
No.
